        {
          "text": "Okole orukingyo orw'okuta ha mulyango gw'Eheema, orukole omu kitaani enyakurangirwe kurungi, enyakusahwirwe ehuuzo ez'erangi eya kaneke, kahukya n'ezirukugaajuka. ",
          "type": "text",
